# XML / InstallSequence docs

Before nontrivial changes here, **Read**:

- [docs/install-sequence-schema.md](docs/install-sequence-schema.md) — tags / attrs
- [docs/architecture.md](docs/architecture.md) — parse, station merge, content remap

Invariants:

- Duplicate station tags merge for **UI only**; export/install keep document `orderIndex`.
- Nested same-tag fold except `group` / `mod` / `component` / `alternatives`.
- XML `modId` is the download folder key — not the WeiDU mod id (see [docs/weidu-install.md](docs/weidu-install.md)).
